  "changes": [
    "Operator-bound native inventory preserves load/maintain choices; scoped native order hook releases manual camera with stopCurrentAction=false without starting/cancelling jobs, defers maintenance inventory close, exact Feuer depth hover wording. Native role/firing/depth rules unchanged; later viewport dials queued."
  ],
  "validation": {
    "compile": "passed",
    "offline": "passed",
    "in_game": "not-run",
    "notes": [
      "Full supplied UBOAT/Unity/Harmony reference compilation passed; 391 targeted offline assertions passed: 316 existing and 75 cleanup/navigation/ordnance/handoff. ZIP/source/CRCs verified. No live .29 run. Native game IL reviewed for inventory binding, task dispatch and stopCurrentAction flag. Native task animation/completion requires owner tests. Exit crash not diagnosed or claimed fixed."
    ]
  },
  "known_issues": [
    "Native load/maintain confirmation, task animation/completion, deferred close, Escape return, saving/exit and MP need live testing. Exit crash remains undiagnosed; quit guard is precaution only. Aft physical inner-door/flood mismatch remains undiagnosed; no physical-state fix claimed. Feuer clipping retune remains queued. No config migration or config-only cleanup command; no depth-rule changes."
